		(property "Description" "Dual-port right-angle BNC jack, each shell independently isolated from the panel and from its neighbour (Amphenol RF 031-6575). Two units, one body: unit 1 = port A (pin 1 centre, pin 2 shell), unit 2 = port B (pin 3 centre, pin 4 shell). Signal-to-net assignment is made where this is placed, the same convention every other connector in this library uses. Replaces the panel-mount vertical BNC whose axis pointed at the chassis lid -- see parametric-audit.md finding F6."
