	)
	(text "CHANNELS 4/5 (PD1_COMP_BUF, PD2_COMP_BUF) ARE NOT OUTBOUND -- they do not reach"
		(at 179.07 321.31 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "484c2d95-ea17-4aaf-bc35-fe42d4c481e2")
	)
	(text "Connector 1 at all. They exist so opto-ni's own U61 LEDs are driven from a"
		(at 179.07 326.39 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "1327af33-d37c-418d-80a9-4242b7772923")
	)
	(text "buffered leg instead of hanging directly on PD1_COMP/PD2_COMP, which wire"
		(at 179.07 331.47 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "45a0e0a8-776f-45fd-8c79-20ff0b87ef24")
	)
	(text "STRAIGHT into the sync module's GPIO20/GPIO21 (3.3V, not 5V tolerant). An LED"
		(at 179.07 336.55 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "258f39ee-8977-4626-bd94-f1f764d7dda4")
	)
	(text "there means +5V through 430R and the LED reaches that pin: idling ~3.6-3.8V"
