	(text "TWO BUFFER OUTPUTS PER OPTOCOUPLER LED (finding F1b, 2026-08-16)."
		(at 560.07 379.73 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "0aa044a1-558f-4458-b118-981ba2282433")
	)
	(text ""
		(at 560.07 384.81 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "655b2d4d-b601-428c-bc3a-737c42b671eb")
	)
	(text "These four packages carry the SECOND output of every LED pair. They exist"
		(at 560.07 389.89000000000004 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "6ee0ed1c-759a-4b58-8c0e-b60ef12f0ee0")
	)
	(text "because the LED series resistor had to fall from 430R to 249R -- at 430R the"
		(at 560.07 394.97 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "86b4433d-e658-4829-b9e2-f61b2931b519")
	)
	(text "LEDs were never guaranteed to switch (~5mA worst case against a 7.0mA I_FH"
		(at 560.07 400.05 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "85146576-ee34-415d-b757-0eeacd66a091")
	)
	(text "minimum, because the +5V rail reaches them through F4 and D3 and the original"
		(at 560.07 405.13 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "7f42c0ad-15e4-4aa0-a898-3747a977accc")
	)
	(text "sizing used a nominal 5.00V and a TYPICAL V_F) -- and 249R draws ~12.7mA,"
		(at 560.07 410.21000000000004 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "9f4369e9-1411-4557-a10e-f9808cad978e")
	)
	(text "which one AHCT541 output cannot sink. Neither value is shippable alone."
		(at 560.07 415.29 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "8ffda78e-ff78-4f77-908d-de013cd45493")
	)
	(text ""
		(at 560.07 420.37 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "1828e00f-fc0b-4d0e-bcce-12a6399b57b7")
	)
	(text "It also fixes a PACKAGE limit no per-pin check can see. AHCT541's GND-pin"
		(at 560.07 425.45000000000005 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "d39974e3-e742-41f2-9883-169a5d5841c0")
	)
	(text "absolute maximum is 75mA; U8 and U9 drive eight LEDs each; the drive is"
		(at 560.07 430.53000000000003 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "d0bce46d-1f67-4725-81fc-d24225f2081d")
	)
	(text "active-low and the event bus idles at 0x0000, so sixteen LEDs are lit"
		(at 560.07 435.61 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "9b6b1d49-c1f0-4da1-9d86-4e70db2ef156")
	)
	(text "CONTINUOUSLY. At 249R unparalleled that is ~101mA through one ground pin."
		(at 560.07 440.69 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "08ce3823-aa55-4921-9b9a-edfe592023cf")
	)
	(text "Paralleled it is ~51mA, and each output pin sees ~6.3mA of a 7.5mA budget."
		(at 560.07 445.77000000000004 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "360820f3-fc13-4368-a594-785a550d6b5f")
	)
	(text ""
		(at 560.07 450.85 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "e3423077-7a1b-448b-854a-d061bf991b92")
	)
	(text "  U70  doubles U8   -- EVT_D0_BUF .. EVT_D7_BUF"
		(at 560.07 455.93 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "aceedd82-b59a-4d62-af4b-a04157df2400")
	)
	(text "  U71  doubles U9   -- EVT_D8_BUF .. EVT_D15_BUF"
		(at 560.07 461.01 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "37ebf08d-d0bd-47a7-9af6-3d2cc5d57dca")
	)
	(text "  U72  doubles U10  -- strobe/RWD_CMD/STIM_TRIG _BUF + the 5 second legs"
		(at 560.07 466.09000000000003 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "ec60a874-7386-4d5b-9886-9cbb12ca9eac")
	)
	(text "  U73  doubles U11's two LED channels -- PD1_COMP_BUF, PD2_COMP_BUF"
		(at 560.07 471.17 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "3b9fdbff-1506-4730-898c-5bc3ba957641")
	)
	(text "       (6 spare channels, the headroom finding F4's camera triggers need)"
		(at 560.07 476.25 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "9c663c85-ca1b-4dd2-8d46-38d301e4a388")
	)
	(text ""
		(at 560.07 481.33000000000004 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "54295b16-8154-46fc-892d-b971b8611e2a")
	)
	(text "Each pair shares ONE input net, and that is a safety requirement rather than"
		(at 560.07 486.41 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "3f0f2221-c3c3-426d-ab4b-448620ebd0bf")
	)
	(text "tidiness: two tri-state outputs on one net are safe only while both are"
		(at 560.07 491.49 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "6686f4f3-fe5c-46b5-9087-49c5e92a972d")
	)
	(text "guaranteed to drive the same direction. If their inputs ever differed, one"
		(at 560.07 496.57000000000005 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "536850b1-7db1-4bb8-b9c2-fa02040ef98a")
	)
	(text "would source while the other sinks, limited by nothing but the two output"
		(at 560.07 501.65000000000003 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "0c262cb6-464b-4e65-9529-c950af586d00")
	)
	(text "stages. The channel maps here are MIRRORED from the tables that built the"
		(at 560.07 506.73 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "791a0a07-96a0-4b2a-ad03-d24a57488e4b")
	)
	(text "first leg rather than retyped, so the two cannot drift apart."
		(at 560.07 511.81000000000006 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "df40330d-fced-4dbb-aef1-3f7b7abd3243")
	)
	(text ""
		(at 560.07 516.89 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "9ea9a07d-ec23-4598-874d-93280d73e52e")
	)
	(text "REFDES U70-U73/C151-C154 are minted OUT OF BAND (explicit strings, never"
		(at 560.07 521.97 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "b663ad52-91b5-4a06-80d7-5676e0891b5e")
	)
	(text "next_ref()), above the whole board's current maximum -- the same mechanism"
		(at 560.07 527.05 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "811dcbec-2e50-4ef1-940e-e9e507400873")
	)
	(text "U69/R191/C149-C150 already use here. An ordinary next_ref() would renumber"
		(at 560.07 532.13 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "53045f23-9fca-4f80-b33c-aad04b8ba690")
	)
	(text "every part placed after it AND every downstream sibling sheet."
		(at 560.07 537.21 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "18dbdb1f-20d3-4f08-97e3-3f03f681b09b")
	)
